    "turn_idx": 4,
    "turn_text": "I became interested in this because of my curiosity. I wanted to find out if there was anything to this, where they're really siding. Was it siding like eight people, nine people, 10 people? And so I decided I would get some money and study it scientifically. And I went to center in a way in Stevens. They controlled the dark man defense budget and told him what I wanted to do. It was one of the easiest cells I ever had because Stephen's immediately said, I was a pilot in World War II. I was flying. Off to my left, there was something. I would move up, down, sideways. I got low on fuel. I had to land. I went down to pass the air traffic control. What was that? It was flying with me. He said, we don't know what you're talking about. So as soon as I told him, I was interested in this. He, based upon his experience in World War II, you want to look at it. So doing it was a, as I said, an easy sell.",
