  {
    "episode_id": 49034,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/9/49034.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "We do know that there have been multiple, multiple sightings of these aerial phenomenon. We don't know what they are. pilots have seen them. Some have lights, some don't, but they go at remarkable speeds up and down at speeds that, if it were, and the present technology we have with our own aircraft, our pilots would die in them because they just wouldn't have stand at G-forces. So we don't know what they are, but I think it's extremely important that we continue trying to find out what they are. Now, the question asks, are they coming from some other nation? We need to look into that. I doubt it, boy, frankly. But it's possible that they're doing some research themselves. Remember, Russia is run by a former member who ran that KGB at his disposal. He had 30,000 agents at one time. So you can venture whatever you want to bet that Russia is looking into this. And I'm confident that China is I know that France is, other countries are looking into it. And America should be waiting for no one who should do it on or on.",
